  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan plans an early entry into Starry Sky grotto-heaven, he treats the aperture as still whole in this life. In his previous life the grotto-heaven had already fallen from high up in Central Continent and broken into tens of immortal aperture fragments, and Seven Star Child had died long before that fall.",
      "chapters": [
        713
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_starry_sky_grotto_heaven",
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a blue robed Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        724
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His body is an immortal zombie resembling a mortal person. Two blue eyes shine brightly. Fang Yuan realizes Seven Star Child had not died but transformed into an immortal zombie, which explains why no heavenly spirit appeared. The immortal zombie first moves on Star Lord Wan Xiang, then turns on Hei Lou Lan with a huge starlight pillar before she escapes the eighth star hall. Fang Yuan judges that long trapping in the dream realm left few thoughts in his mind and slowed his cognition.",
      "chapters": [
        725
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-zombie-identity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang",
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After he regains his senses he tells Immortal Monkey King Shi Lei that Shi Lei’s awakening freed him from that dream realm, and he fights to keep control of the grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        727
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "control-of-the-grotto-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shi_lei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Combat Immortal Sect did not expect him to be so resolute that he would rather drag everyone down with him, causing Starry Sky grotto-heaven to shatter and fall. He self-detonated the grotto-heaven but controlled the explosion so almost no Gu Immortals could enter the fragment worlds, only their disciples.",
      "chapters": [
        909
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "control-of-the-grotto-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_combat_immortal_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Beside immortal zombie Bo Qing stand the owner of Starry Sky grotto-heaven, Envoy Blue of Shadow Sect, who is immortal zombie Seven Star Child, together with the blood path demonic immortal Song Zi Xing and the hairy man refinement path Gu Immortal Yu Mu Chun. Seven Star Child speaks for the group and says he, Song Zi Xing, and Yu Mu Chun will use an immortal killer move to transport the four of them to Central Continent’s north-east region to attack Heavenly Lotus Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-envoy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bo_qing",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "char_song_zi_xing",
        "char_yu_mu_chun",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s previous life Bo Qing could not attack Heavenly Lotus Sect and struck Combat Immortal Sect instead, which made Shadow Sect’s earlier arrangements useless, and among this life’s divergences Vice Envoy Blue, who is Seven Star Child, does not die.",
      "chapters": [
        1003
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-envoy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "These Shadow Sect Gu Immortals are Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s split souls. After discussion, Shadow Sect’s Gu Immortals, including Seven Star Child and Song Zi Xing, enter the formation and sacrifice themselves.",
      "chapters": [
        1011
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-envoy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A past Shadow Sect member, one of the seven original split souls, Seven Star Child, went ahead to devour a fragment of immemorial blue heaven while trying to research a way to deal with heaven’s will. Heaven’s will made use of that and left him stuck inside Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s dream realm, unable to get out.",
      "chapters": [
        1119
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-envoy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_heavens_will",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    }
  ],
